 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Tier shelf: old flat model lists turned into platform-family ranges with tier levels where a retrieved page gave them (Phonak Infinio 90/70, Oticon Intent 1-4, Real 1-3, Own 5 levels, ReSound Nexia 9/7/5, Sensia 9/7/5/4, Starkey Omega/Edge AI 24/20/16, Evolv AI 2400-1000). Cross-family repeats removed (Oticon Own, ReSound custom, Starkey Signature only on ITE/ITC as custom ranges). Hearing-aid battery and Hearing-aid ear tip merged into Hearing-aid spare parts; 15 dome SKUs cut to one per maker. New kinds: Over-the-counter hearing aid (FDA page), Implant sound processor (Cochlear implant wiki). Left out: Widex 110-440 and Signia 7/5/3 tier numbers (no retrieved maker page confirmed them for current families), Ponto 5 versions (maker pages 404), Jabra Enhance and Sony brand entries (no brand page retrieved); no archetypes (tier shelf). Brand country for Advanced Bionics left blank (not on retrieved page)."
